{"asset_key":"ep8/quest_story_18107641","episode":"ep8","category":"quest_story","story_id":"18107641","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:3:1810764101:1":{"text":"My memories are coming back...","source_cn":"我……我的记忆……我想起来了……<key:dialog1>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5900424F14BBB7DA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1810764102:0":{"text":"*Sob* Baden!","source_cn":"呜呜呜……巴登！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2F10982E36DB6F70","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1810764103:0":{"text":"... I'm glad.","source_cn":"……想起来就好。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4A366B7C91645427","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1810764104:0":{"text":"Easy there, Estrilda. You're the head of the house now, no more crying like a kid.","source_cn":"好啦，爱丝……你现在可是家主，不能再哭鼻子了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC722CB5E5E53E1E7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1810764105:0":{"text":"And you, Thane. Look a little happier, would you? Let's see a smile.","source_cn":"还有瑟恩，你不应该更高兴吗？笑一笑吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9E99B3573A7E021D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1810764106:0":{"text":"... You don't have to put on a brave face for us, Baden.","source_cn":"……你不必这样强颜欢笑。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x44DE5247598FF46A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1810764107:0":{"text":"...","source_cn":"………………","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x197F0BE8A09E0D34","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1810764108:0":{"text":"About Baba Muriel... I am truly sorry. But I had to make that choice.","source_cn":"穆婆婆的事……对不起。那是我必须做的选择。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE085D1BA5F959F3A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1810764109:1":{"text":"... Yeah, I know.","source_cn":"……嗯，我知道。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDD2944543751FE2C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1810764110:0":{"text":"Thank you, Thane. For raising Estrilda, for searching for me, for risking your life for me over and over again. You've already done more than enough. Stop blaming yourself.","source_cn":"谢谢你，瑟恩。培养爱丝、寻找我、一次次舍身救我……你已...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5C1594582819F5A8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1810764111:0":{"text":"I could never hate you.\nI just... need a moment to grieve.","source_cn":"我不会责怪你，更不会恨你。\\n只是我现在……有点悲伤。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4B31024BAAEEC5FB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1810764112:0":{"text":"Baden...","source_cn":"巴登……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8F18279B6D894431","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1810764113:0":{"text":"We've fought Bantus for so long, we always thought the Graveborn were just soulless, unfeeling monsters. But... Baba Muriel gave up her existence just to save me.","source_cn":"我们一直与班题斯为敌，总觉得亡灵全是毫无人性的怪物。可...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8CA52F6FD9647C8A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1810764114:1":{"text":"Maybe she got some of Bayanu's memories... but the warmth and care she gave me while I was \"Rain\" were entirely real.","source_cn":"虽然她的确受到了巴亚茄老师记忆的影响……但在我以“里纳...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3BFF534D97E019FC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1810764115:1":{"text":"She was a Graveborn, she knew I was a human... and right now, I'm grieving her loss.","source_cn":"她是亡灵，也知道我是生者……而我现在，正在为她的离开而痛苦。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC41E7A1CEEDAA67C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1810764116:1":{"text":"I...","source_cn":"我……<key:dialog858>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA388BF99B2CD5A83","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1810764117:1":{"text":"...","source_cn":"………………","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x197F0BE8A09E0D34","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1810764118:1":{"text":"Do you remember what our commander used to drill into us? \"When someone falls—\"","source_cn":"你还记得我们教官常说的话吧？“有人倒下后——”","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBE097DFB081A1229","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1810764119:1":{"text":"\"We become the path they left unfinished.\"","source_cn":"“——我们便是他的未竟之路。”","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x738768732D4174E0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1810764120:1":{"text":"So live well. That's how you honor her sacrifice.","source_cn":"所以，你好好活着，就不负她的牺牲。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB16603ED2EC6E86B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1810764121:1":{"text":"... Mhm.","source_cn":"……嗯。<key:dialog808>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA83B645BB6A5DBAD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1810764122:1":{"text":"By the way, how did you two even end up in Novaris? How are things in Ashvale County? Who's holding the line?","source_cn":"对了，为什么你和爱丝都跑到诺珐斯来了？灰影郡战况如何？...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xECFAFF227F6BF556","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:29:1810764123:0":{"text":"Sorry. After Thane left, I couldn't just sit at home and wait.","source_cn":"对不起。瑟恩离开后，我实在没法安心待在灰影郡干等着。<...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x42AB1C2B2DC0C18E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:30:1810764124:0":{"text":"So... I abandoned my post and came after him. But don't worry! I handled everything I could think of before leaving!","source_cn":"所以……我就擅自离岗了。但你不用担心，我把能想到的事情...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x97E237D4EA37395B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:31:1810764125:0":{"text":"Estrilda gives Baden a quick summary of the defensive arrangements she made before departing.","source_cn":"爱丝特瑞达向巴登简单叙述了一遍她的安排。<key:di...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC988A36AC084E5B3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:32:1810764126:1":{"text":"Well done, Estrilda. You've grown into a real leader. House Rayne is in good hands.","source_cn":"干得好，爱丝……你比以前稳重了很多。不愧是我们瑞恩家族...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB864BAAF3FF7CC9E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:33:1810764127:1":{"text":"Baden... I abandoned my post. I don't deserve to remain head of the family.","source_cn":"巴登，我擅离职守，不配再为家主，理应受罚。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8E1956B82D517C18","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:34:1810764128:1":{"text":"When you return to Ashvale County, I'll accept my punishment.","source_cn":"等你回到灰影郡后，以家主的身份处置我吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1C6CFB30BA04723A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:35:1810764129:1":{"text":"No. <style=\"highlight\">I won't be returning to Ashvale County just yet.</style>","source_cn":"不，爱丝……<style=highlight>我暂时不...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0652B54B260E0E7A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:36:1810764130:1":{"text":"Then where are you going?!","source_cn":"那你要去哪里？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA8559F8251943F8A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:37:1810764131:1":{"text":"To the Whispering Isles. I need to see what happened there myself.","source_cn":"去幽声群岛，看看那里的情况。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFB4A97F44A5A1F8D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:38:1810764132:1":{"text":"The fact that Baba Muriel inherited Bayanu's limbs means the conflict there is much worse than we thought.","source_cn":"巴亚茄老师的肢体被穆婆婆所继承，说明幽声群岛的战况不容...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD6615AD7BD8C70A1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:39:1810764133:0":{"text":"But you just got your memories back! At least come home first...","source_cn":"可是你才刚找回记忆！至少……至少也该回灰影郡看看……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x20CAE50921BD16EA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:40:1810764134:0":{"text":"*Cough* Ahaha...","source_cn":"咳……呵呵呵……<key:dialog1>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x19867A66BF22B520","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:43:1810764135:0":{"text":"A soft, melodic laugh echoes through the room as Tephesia suddenly appears beside you.","source_cn":"伴随着轻快的笑声，苔佩希的身影忽然出现在了你身边。<k...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x36016168AD06ECA9","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"A soft, melodic laugh echoes through the room as Tephesia suddenly appears beside you.","female":"A soft, melodic laugh echoes through the room as Tephesia suddenly appears beside you.","variant_male_record_index":"244915","variant_female_record_index":"244916","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:44:1810764136:0":{"text":"Miss Rayne, you really are delightfully naive. The nightmare unfolding in the Whispering Isles is far more wretched than you realize.","source_cn":"瑞恩小姐，你太天真了。幽声群岛的现状比你们的预估更为可怕。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCD49AB88618DA463","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:45:1810764137:0":{"text":"Come now, let my messenger show you the intelligence we've gathered on Bantus.","source_cn":"来吧，让余的信使给你们看看班题斯的情报。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE640BA95DCFB4A7E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:巴登":{"text":"Baden","source":"巴登","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:爱丝特瑞达":{"text":"Estrilda","source":"爱丝特瑞达","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:瑟恩":{"text":"Thane","source":"瑟恩","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:巴登&瑟恩":{"text":"Baden & Thane","source":"巴登&瑟恩","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:旁白":{"text":"Narrator","source":"旁白","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:苔佩希的声音":{"text":"Tephesia","source":"苔佩希的声音","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:苔佩希":{"text":"Tephesia","source":"苔佩希","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":38,"localized_text_count":37,"speaker_count":7}}